{"duration": 65.338, "exact_word_timing": true, "lines": [{"beat": 0, "text": "Lavoisier chased a strange gas that made fire burn fiercely.", "start": 0.08, "end": 3.423}, {"beat": 1, "text": "Priestley told Lavoisier about the strange gas.", "start": 3.843, "end": 6.198}, {"beat": 1, "text": "Priestley thought the gas was just a purer form of common air.", "start": 6.418, "end": 9.406}, {"beat": 1, "text": "Lavoisier ran his own experiments on the gas instead.", "start": 9.626, "end": 12.372}, {"beat": 2, "text": "Marie-Anne translated Kirwan's book on phlogiston for him.", "start": 12.792, "end": 15.967}, {"beat": 2, "text": "Marie-Anne's footnotes convinced Lavoisier that the old fire theory was wrong.", "start": 16.187, "end": 20.2}, {"beat": 2, "text": "Lavoisier studied burning and discovered oxygen gas.", "start": 20.42, "end": 23.471}, {"beat": 3, "text": "Revolutionaries charged Lavoisier with tax fraud and selling adulterated tobacco.", "start": 23.891, "end": 28.708}, {"beat": 3, "text": "Revolutionaries guillotined him in 1794.", "start": 28.928, "end": 31.995}, {"beat": 3, "text": "Marie-Anne fought for Lavoisier's release, and France later cleared his name.", "start": 32.215, "end": 36.064}, {"beat": 4, "text": "You see, it's like a soda bottle: the air above the drink rushes out.", "start": 36.484, "end": 39.983}, {"beat": 5, "text": "In a sealed wine bottle, the headspace is the gas space above the wine.", "start": 40.403, "end": 44.077}, {"beat": 5, "text": "That headspace holds oxygen.", "start": 44.297, "end": 45.91}, {"beat": 5, "text": "As the wine uses oxygen, gas moves from the headspace into the wine.", "start": 46.13, "end": 49.909}, {"beat": 5, "text": "The sealed bottle becomes an oxygen reserve, feeding oxygen into the wine.", "start": 50.129, "end": 54.279}, {"beat": 6, "text": "The bottle's oxygen reserve was measured in a modern wine study, published in 2006.", "start": 54.699, "end": 60.025}, {"beat": 6, "text": "Lavoisier's lasting idea was simpler: matter is never made or lost.", "start": 60.245, "end": 64.218}], "words": [{"w": "Lavoisier", "start": 0.145, "end": 0.645, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "chased", "start": 0.695, "end": 0.945, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "a", "start": 0.97, "end": 0.995, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "strange", "start": 1.045, "end": 1.42, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "gas", "start": 1.47, "end": 1.945, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "that", "start": 1.995, "end": 2.095, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "made", "start": 2.12, "end": 2.295, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "fire", "start": 2.345, "end": 2.62, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "burn", "start": 2.67, "end": 2.92, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "fiercely.", "start": 2.995, "end": 3.472, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "Priestley", "start": 3.909, "end": 4.284, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "told", "start": 4.334, "end": 4.534, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "Lavoisier", "start": 4.559, "end": 5.109, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "about", "start": 5.159, "end": 5.309, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "the", "start": 5.334, "end": 5.384, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "strange", "start": 5.434, "end": 5.784, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "gas.", "start": 5.834, "end": 6.254, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "Priestley", "start": 6.458, "end": 6.833, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "thought", "start": 6.883, "end": 7.058, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "the", "start": 7.083, "end": 7.133, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "gas", "start": 7.183, "end": 7.508, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "was", "start": 7.558, "end": 7.658, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "just", "start": 7.708, "end": 7.908, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "a", "start": 7.933, "end": 7.983, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "purer", "start": 8.058, "end": 8.358, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "form", "start": 8.433, "end": 8.683, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "of", "start": 8.708, "end": 8.783, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "common", "start": 8.833, "end": 9.158, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "air.